      "report_types": [
        "threat-report"
      ],
      "published": "2025-08-27T00:00:00.000Z",
      "description": "In its August 2025 Threat Intelligence Report, Anthropic disclosed a UK-based threat actor it tracked as GTG-5004 that used Claude to develop, market and sell ransomware with evasion features through a ransomware-as-a-service model. Anthropic reports the actor — active since at least January 2025 on dark-web forums — appears dependent on the AI to produce functional malware, and sold ransomware packages priced from US$400 to US$1,200.",
      "labels": [
